  "appVersion": "App version",
  "privacyBody": "Smart Dukan aapka saara data isi phone par, encrypted database mein rakhta hai. Na account, na server, aur app internet par kuch nahi bhejti.\n\nKya mehfooz hota hai: dukan ki maloomat, maal, stock, gahak aur supplier, sales, khareedari, payments, kharche, repair jobs aur qist plans.\n\nTasveerein: bill, device aur (sirf agar aap on karein) seller ke CNIC ki tasveerein phone ke secure keystore wali chaabi se encrypted hoti hain. CNIC tasveerein aapki chuni hui muddat ke baad khud delete ho jati hain. Sirf malik aur manager CNIC dekh sakte hain aur har dafa record hota hai.\n\nShare: data phone se sirf tab nikalta hai jab aap bill, statement ya report share karein, ya backup save karein. Backup hamesha aapke password se encrypted hota hai.\n\nKoi analytics, ads ya tracking nahi. Play Data Safety: koi data jama ya share nahi hota.",
  "termsBody": "Mobile Shop Pro ek device ke liye ek dafa ka licence hai. Is mein bug fixes aur compatibility updates shamil hain.\n\nTransfer: phone badlein to naye phone par backup restore karein aur dono Device Codes WhatsApp par bhejein. Seller naye phone ka naya code dega aur purana licence transferred likh dega.\n\nHad: offline app copy kiya hua licence wapas nahi le sakti. Licence aapke Device Code se bandha hai taake share karna mushkil ho, aur seller ek register (licence id, Device Code, khareedar ka phone, tareekh) rakhta hai.\n\nAapka record hamesha aapka: Pro band ho to bhi Pro record parha aur export kiya ja sakta hai.",
  "helpVideosBody": "Sale, stock, khata aur backup ki chhoti videos hamare WhatsApp channel par hain. Link apne seller se lein.",
  "healthCheckHint": "Hidden Health Check ke liye app version ko dabaye rakhein.",
